The main changes from upstream are: the judging/ranking step now runs the local
Cloudflare clef-flash decision model over llama.cpp's `/v1/systemone`; the drafting
step runs a second local text model; app/local_server.py launches and supervises the
llama-server processes; local providers are the defaults and need no API keys;
project branding and the update-check URL point to this repository; the upstream
WeChat banner is removed; and this project is distributed under Apache-2.0 while
upstream portions remain MIT.

