upstream authors. This project does not use them to imply endorsement, only for
factual attribution.

The model weights (Cloudflare clef-flash, Apache-2.0) are NOT included in this
repository; download them yourself. The Windows release bundle additionally
includes PySide6-Fluent-Widgets (GPLv3, free for non-commercial use), so the
bundle as a whole is bound by GPLv3 terms.
